        "DefaultText": "Hopped Ale"
    },
    "CardDescription": {
        "ParentObjectID": "herbs_fungi_lq_hopped_ale",
        "LocalizationKey": "Herbs_And_Fungi_HoppedAle_CardDescription",
        "DefaultText": "Rye ale steeped with hop cones. Bitter, a little flowery and slow to spoil.\n\nDrink in moderation!"
    },
    "CardHelpSection": {
        "ParentObjectID": "herbs_fungi_lq_hopped_ale",
        "LocalizationKey": "Herbs_And_Fungi_HoppedAle_CardHelpSection",
        "DefaultText": "<b>Made from:</b> Drag Hops onto a bowl of finished rye ale. Fresh wort will not take them: let the wort ferment first. The hops are used up.\n\n<b>Keeps:</b> It spoils half as fast as plain rye ale. It does not freeze and does not age further in a barrel."
    },
